  - [`src/frontend/voice.ts:131-132`](file:///Users/rodrigosonsino/Documents/Codex/2026-09-11/referenced-chatgpt-conversation-this-is-an/outputs/rodrigo-ai/src/frontend/voice.ts#L131-L132)
